### Issue description

An outer query selecting from a CTE appears to incorrectly consider a table alias from inside the CTE body to still be in scope.

In the example, right_dataframe is only referenced inside the join_results CTE. The outer query’s FROM clause is only join_results, so the unqualified "key" should resolve to join_results."key". Instead, Polars reports ambiguity between join_results."key" and right_dataframe."key".

### Expected behavior

Both cases should pass

